# JOURNEY · the Pufferfish: puff, and cash out before it has grown at all, which hands the stake
# straight back. Cashing out is ENTER, the key that puffed it.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
run /casino pufferfish
expect Pufferfish
expect ENTER puff
key up
expect Auto ×1.5
key down
expect Auto off
key enter
expect ENTER cash out
key enter
expect cashed out at ×1
expect stake back
snap cashed out at once, the stake comes back
key esc
key esc
absent ENTER puff
